+### Average Durations
+
+Use `average` to get the mean in milliseconds of a list of durations, each a duration string or a number of milliseconds.
+
+```ts
+import { average } from 'ms';
+
+average(['1m', '3m']); // 120000
+average([1000, '3s']); // 2000
+```
+
 ### Enhanced Type Safety
 
 If you want strict type checking for the input value, you can use `parseStrict`.
